{"id":477,"name":"Dusknoir","slug":"dusknoir","types":["ghost"],"generation":4,"region":"Sinnoh","favoriteRank":null,"artworkUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/477.png","flavorText":"The antenna on its head captures radio waves from the world of spirits that command it to take people there.","description":"Dusknoir is the Gripper Pokémon, a Ghost-type first discovered in the Sinnoh region. It stands 7'03\" (2.2 m) tall and weighs 235.0 lbs (106.6 kg). Comes to those whose lives have come to an end and escorts their souls to the afterlife. Known to mistakenly take the souls of those who yet have life left in them, albeit rarely. With the mouth on its belly, Dusknoir swallows its target whole. The soul is the only thing eaten— Dusknoir disgorges the body before departing.","evolution":{"from":{"id":356,"name":"Dusclops"},"to":[]},"family":{"stages":[[{"id":355,"name":"Duskull"}],[{"id":356,"name":"Dusclops"}],[{"id":477,"name":"Dusknoir"}]],"megas":[]},"cards":[{"rank":1,"cardId":"bw10-104","name":"Dusknoir","set":"Plasma Blast","rarity":"Secret Rare","imageUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/bw/bw10/104/high.webp","thumbUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/bw/bw10/104/low.webp","price":145.22,"currency":"USD","variant":"holofoil"},{"rank":2,"cardId":"dp7-96","name":"Dusknoir","set":"Stormfront","rarity":"Rare Holo LV.X","imageUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/dp/dp7/96/high.webp","thumbUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/dp/dp7/96/low.webp","price":69.12,"currency":"USD","variant":"holofoil"},{"rank":3,"cardId":"sv06.5-070","name":"Dusknoir","set":"Shrouded Fable","rarity":"Illustration rare","imageUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/sv/sv06.5/070/high.webp","thumbUrl":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/sv/sv06.5/070/low.webp","price":31.66,"currency":"USD","variant":"holofoil"},{"rank":4,"cardId":"smp-SM217","name":"Trevenant & Dusknoir GX","set":"SM Black Star Promos","rarity":"Promo","imageUrl":"https://ass